  message: "Sample 2026-11-25 (424 resolved call edges of the 51-tree baseline, drawn at random per mark, judged blind from source by eight judges; ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/sample_11252026/results.md): Rust same_file: 7 wrong of 8. req.headers() on the Request returned by RequestBuilder::build bound to RequestBuilder::headers of the same file (three times); empty_body.size_hint() on a Body bound to IntoBytesBody::size_hint; a chain ending .positional_order_by(2) bound to the #[test] fn of that name in the file. The receiver is the result of a call or a chain, so it is untyped for the analyzer, and the file's short-name table answers. Also Rust receiver_type with a shared owner name: 6 wrong of 6 (five are x.as_expression() on a generic T bound to a blanket impl of a trait that is not in scope)."  # 3981
